asional toast and reheating, but daily users often regret uneven browning, flimsy controls, and weaker build quality.</p></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>Can a toaster oven replace a full-size oven?</summary><p class="faq-answer">A larger toaster oven can replace a full-size oven for many small meals, frozen pizza, roasting, reheating, and weeknight cooking. It will not fully replace a large oven for big batches or holiday cooking.</p></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>Which toaster oven should most people buy?</summary><p class="faq-answer">Most people should start with the Cuisinart Chef's Convection Toaster Oven because it has the strongest overall balance of cooking consistency, useful capacity, daily usability, and cleaner availability.</p></details>
